message: If you use these materials, please cite them as below.
type: dataset
title: 'Paper Autograder — Rubric-Based Draft Grading'
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-17
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU
url: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU/tree/main/mlu/ml-ai-applications/mlu-000004-paper-autograder
abstract: >-
  Point this notebook at your course material, a grading rubric, and a folder of student
  papers. For each paper it scores every rubric criterion, backs each score with verbatim
  quotes, computes the weighted grade in code rather than in the model, and drafts
  separate notes for the instructor and for the student. Runs on Bedrock or fully local
  via Ollama, where nothing leaves the machine.
authors:
